// Species for the visualization study's comparison task ("which species'
// observations have the higher average annual mean temperature?"). Generated
// offline from the occurrence data; same selection and geographic crop as
// studyPool.ts (2,000-5,000 observations, all but <= 1% fit one zoom-4
// window, `viewBox`), but with NO spread restriction - pairs are matched on
// spread/entropy/size instead (see studyCompare.ts). Only species that have
// at least one valid 20-30 F partner are listed.
//   meanF:     mean annual mean temperature over the displayed observations
//   cellMeanF: the same, averaged over occupied map cells (each place once);
//              a pair is only valid when both agree on which species is hotter

import type { StudyViewBox } from '@/components/sections/studyPool';

